  "description": "New York, November 1912. P.I. Max Buchanan is approached by Jimmy Murray to look into his brother Tom’s death. The suspect? Jane Murray, Tom’s widow. As Max begins his investigation, Jane only seems more suspicious. Widowed two times, both under suspicious circumstances. Ties to a gang. A clear motive. But despite himself, Max can’t help but feel some pity for her. And it’s clear that Jimmy is hiding something as well…\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
